{"id":72795,"date":"2026-11-05T18:29:27","date_gmt":"2026-11-05T18:29:27","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72795"},"modified":"2026-11-05T19:30:56","modified_gmt":"2026-11-05T18:30:56","slug":"corrida-sao-silvestre-de-vila-de-rei","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-sao-silvestre-de-vila-de-rei\/","title":{"rendered":"1\u00aa Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vila de Rei 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">1\u00aa Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vila de Rei 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>1\u00aa Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vila de Rei 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>26 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (s\u00e1bado), com partida da prova principal agendada para as <strong>16:00<\/strong> junto ao <strong>Edif\u00edcio dos Pa\u00e7os do Concelho de Vila de Rei<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Castelo Branco<\/strong>. Organizada pelo <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Vila de Rei<\/strong> (atrav\u00e9s da Divis\u00e3o de Turismo, Cultura, Ambiente, Desporto e Juventude), esta edi\u00e7\u00e3o inaugural leva a tradi\u00e7\u00e3o festiva das corridas de final de ano ao Centro Geod\u00e9sico de Portugal num tra\u00e7ado circular 100% urbano.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento compreende uma <strong>Corrida de Estrada de 10 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s 16:00, destinada a atletas a partir dos 16 anos, com abastecimento l\u00edquido ao km 5 e medalha <em>finisher<\/em>) e uma <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> n\u00e3o competitiva (partida \u00e0s 16:30, aberta a participantes a partir dos 8 anos). A jornada encerra com anima\u00e7\u00e3o musical na meta \u00e0s 18:00, lanche conv\u00edvio inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0s 18:30 e cerim\u00f3nia de entrega de pr\u00e9mios \u00e0s 19:00, atribuindo vouchers de compras no com\u00e9rcio local (75 \u20ac, 50 \u20ac e 35 \u20ac) aos p\u00f3dios da geral e de cada escal\u00e3o. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rg