 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Munic\u00edpio de Vila de Rei<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/admin\/upload\/ficheiros\/ficheirosMultimedia\/normas-corrida-sao-silvestre-vila-de-rei.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\">\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li><div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas & Sub-eventos<\/strong><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 26 de Dezembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 16:00 \u2022 \u23f1\ufe0f Limite: Abastecimento l\u00edquido ao km 5 e na meta<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">10,00 \u20ac (at\u00e9 30\/11) | 12,50 \u20ac (01 a 18\/12)<\/span><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 5 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 26 de Dezembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 16:30 \u2022 \u23f1\ufe0f Limite: Sem fins competitivos<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">8,00 \u20ac (at\u00e9 30\/11) | 10,00 \u20ac (01 a 18\/12)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a 1\u00aa Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vila de Rei 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 1\u00aa Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vila de Rei realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 26 de dezembro de 2026, com partida e chegada junto ao Edif\u00edcio dos Pa\u00e7os do Concelho de Vila de Rei (Castelo Branco). A Corrida de 10 km parte \u00e0s 16:00 (briefing \u00e0s 15:45) e a Caminhada de 5 km parte \u00e0s 16:30 (briefing \u00e0s 16:25).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">At\u00e9 30 de novembro de 2026 (1\u00ba per\u00edodo), a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o custa 10,00 \u20ac na Corrida de 10 km e 8,00 \u20ac na Caminhada de 5 km. De 1 a 18 de dezembro de 2026 (2\u00ba per\u00edodo), o valor passa para 12,50 \u20ac na Corrida e 10,00 \u20ac na Caminhada. Todos os participantes recebem lanche conv\u00edvio e podem adquirir a t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial por um suplemento opcional de 5,00 \u20ac.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e a que horas funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona no pr\u00f3prio dia da prova (26 de dezembro de 2026), entre as 14:00 e as 15:30, no Edif\u00edcio dos Pa\u00e7os do Concelho de Vila de Rei.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que pr\u00e9mios s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos na Corrida de 10 km?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todos os atletas que concluam os 10 km recebem medalha de finisher. Os tr\u00eas primeiros classificados da geral e de cada escal\u00e3o (masculino e feminino) recebem vouchers para descontar no com\u00e9rcio local de Vila de Rei no valor de 75,00 \u20ac (1\u00ba lugar), 50,00 \u20ac (2\u00ba lugar) e 35,00 \u20ac (3\u00ba lugar), al\u00e9m de trof\u00e9us para as 3 melhores equipas, melhores atletas residentes no concelho e equipa\/associa\u00e7\u00e3o mais numerosa.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a entidade organizadora e o contacto oficial?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pelo Munic\u00edpio de Vila de Rei (Divis\u00e3o de Turismo, Cultura, Ambiente, Desporto e Juventude), disponibilizando o e-mail oficial desporto@cm-viladerei.pt e o regulamento completo em PDF.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"1\u00aa Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vila de Rei 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-26\", \"endDate\": \"2026-12-26\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Vila de Rei, Castelo Branco\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vila de Rei\", \"addressRegion\": \"Castelo Branco\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A 1\u00aa Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vila de Rei 2026 realiza-se a 26 de dezembro em Vila de Rei (Castelo Branco). Corrida 10 km, caminhada 5 km e inscri\u00e7\u00f5es abertas!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/cartaz-corrida-sao-silvestre-de-vila-de-rei.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre 10 km\", \"price\": \"10.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/1-Corrida-Sao-Silvestre-Vila-de-Rei\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada 5 km\", \"price\": \"8.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilh